WEBVTT

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.630
It is time to take you on another
journey into the book worlds.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.900
It looks like such a peaceful place,
but things aren't always what they seem...

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.400
Come on, give it up already.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:03.130
I want to see you but I can't
see you because it hurts so much.

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:07.230
I'm sure I must
be missing something...

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.460
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:14.560
(Yami, the Hat and the Book traveler)
...and that's why my
prayer hasn't been answered.

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:21.500
I had always believed
that what I saw before me...

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:28.300
...was the only truth there was.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:36.130
But now I know
there isn't just one world.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:45.600
There are a thousand worlds called
"if" and I don't know which way to turn.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:51.500
I want to see you but
I can't see you; where are you now?

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.630
I'll find you no matter the cost.

00:01:54.830 --> 00:02:02.460
I've wandered into the
labyrinth of your eyes.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:06.400
Even if the darkness bars my path...

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.400
...even if my weak heart
is led astray, I won't give up.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:17.360
I'll keep searching for you.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.830
Fairy Magic
Flame Throw Explosion!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.860
Fujihime

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:46.300
You think you can fight
us with this kind of magic?

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:47.300
Ready to die?!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:54.360
Who are you?

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:56.900
That's unmanly of you.

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.830
You got lucky today, fox witch.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.160
But you will get
no second chance.

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.230
You too.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.530
You saved my life!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.900
Thank you so much!

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.630
My name is Meiri, the Youku.

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:55.230
Youku is not a person's name,
it's a fox demon.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.760
Can I call you "big sis"?

00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.560
By the way, your outfit
is very unusual, what is it?

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.500
A sailor outfit.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:07.000
Not even demons have such
weird things, where did you get it?

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:08.900
Who were those samurais?

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.160
They're the guards of the bamboo
fortress on top of that mountain.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:17.200
I was just trying to pass by and
they made such a big deal out of it.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:21.300
Bamboo fortress.

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.760
My apologies, princess.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:30.230
We were so close to
destroying that fox witch.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:32.130
I understand.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:35.700
But even a fox witch,
it is a living creature.

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:38.560
Can you try not to hurt her?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:44.700
With all due respect,
she's a kind of demon.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:47.360
We cannot allow her any
possibility of risk to your safety.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:51.400
Indeed. Protecting you is
our highest priority and duty.

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:55.160
Such is the law of the Bamboo
clan who have served your family...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.800
...from generation to generation.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:57.960
Please try to understand.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:06.830
Oh, where did Hazuki go?

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:10.360
I bet she hasn't gone far.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:14.900
We all came here together.

00:05:16.030 --> 00:05:17.660
She doesn't need to be so mean.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.100
She said "I'll go find Hatsumi."

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.360
Oh, you came at
the perfect time.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:29.600
Did you see a girl dressed
like this with a really mean look?

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.200
Hey!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:35.500
Oh?

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.060
Wow, she can run fast.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:51.600
A mysterious power?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:55.600
Just between you and I,
it is said that the princess...

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:58.730
...in the Bamboo fortress
has mysterious powers.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:04.230
So I was thinking that if I get close
to her, I could increase my powers.

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:16.530
I don't know why but the closer
I get, the stranger the feeling I get.

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.760
You are late, Suzuka.

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:52.030
I am sorry, my lord.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:05.000
We, Oboro kunoichi clan
are here, ready to serve you.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:08.100
Finally, the order has
arrived from the country.

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.060
Grand master, we are all
honored and at your disposal.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:13.730
We must abduct the
princess from Bamboo fortress...

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.460
...and bring to our Highness.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.900
If we can obtain
the power from the princess,...

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:22.160
...our lord can declare
himself ruler of this country.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:26.600
Tonight, we will
attack the Bamboo fortress.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:27.560
Yes sir.

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:16.430
Why did I come all the way here?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:22.260
Just because of a
funny feeling I had?

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:28.330
It is said that the princess in the
Bamboo fortress has magical powers.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.760
Hatsumi.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:35.530
Princess, where are you?

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:36.800
In the garden.

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:43.600
It's not safe over there,
please don't fall in the lake.

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.900
I'm fine.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.200
Hatsumi!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.860
If my magic doesn't
work on those samurais,...

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:21.060
...then it will be
harder to get to the fortress.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:27.230
It would be of great help
if "big sis" was on my side.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.460
It's really such a hassle.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:36.430
Exactly.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:41.530
I don't wanna die, but I really
want to increase my magical powers.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.960
Of course, nothing is guaranteed
even if I do get to the princess.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:47.160
Sounds like a tough choice.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.760
Yeah, it's not
easy being a fox witch.

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:53.460
If I don't increase my powers...

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:54.960
Huh?

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.730
I get it, totally.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:09:59.800
Who are you?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.230
Lilith.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.060
And I'm Ken!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:22.360
Hatsumi.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:34.400
Intruder!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.200
Everyone, come here!

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:45.860
You again, the
friend of the fox witch.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.500
I've come to take her back.

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:50.530
What?

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:55.400
Do you actually think
we would do such a thing?

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:00.600
Kill!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:01.830
No!

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:05.000
But princess...

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:08.360
Hatsumi.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:12.930
Princess.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.660
How can I help you?

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.830
Hatsumi, it's me, Hazuki!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.430
You don't have to pretend
like you don't know me.

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:28.730
You only stumbled upon in
this place by mistake, right?

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:32.100
If your name is not really
Hatsumi, I'll call you Eve, that's okay.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.560
Have you forgotten me? I'm
your younger sister, Hazuki!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:50.600
I am sorry, I am Princess
Fuji of the Bamboo fortress.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.960
I'm not the one
you're looking for.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.600
But that comb...

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:06.000
...it's the one that
belonged to Hatsumi.

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:13.030
This comb is a family treasure
passed down for generations.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.660
I was born and
raised in this fortress.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:20.660
This is my first
time I've met you.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.330
Bring this lady to my quarters.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.200
Princess!

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.400
She doesn't seem
like a bad person.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:44.900
Please.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.330
Have you seen this girl?

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.460
Oh, it's "sis."

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:57.900
Yeah, I met her
near that mountain.

00:12:58.230 --> 00:12:59.560
Then where did she go?

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:01.860
To the Bamboo fortress, maybe.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:05.960
Hey, can you take me there?

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.330
By the look of her outfit,...

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.960
...she must be another
extraordinary person like that "sis."

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:22.730
They can help me
increase my powers.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.530
Well, what a coincidence.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:30.060
My older sister always said
that anybody with a western accent...

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.800
...is a good person.

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.100
What a coincidence!

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.630
My grandpa told
me the same thing.

00:13:35.400 --> 00:13:37.800
Okay then, let's go
to Bamboo fortress!

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:39.530
Okay!

00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:55.800
Who are they?

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:01.100
The fox girl has
been around this area...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:04.460
...but her magic
skills are childish.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.300
So we don't need
to worry about her.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.700
The other girl in the strange
outfit seems to be a traveller...

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.600
...who just arrived in the village.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.700
They won't get in
our way, will they?

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:19.760
No. At first I was cautious
but they're just outcasts.

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.400
Why did you save me?

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:35.260
You didn't look
like a bad person.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:40.300
Hatsumi used to smile like that.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.830
You really look
exactly like her.

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:52.430
This is the same comb
that your sister used?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.600
This has belonged to
your family for generations?

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:00.600
Yes.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:03.800
I don't know how
long it goes back...

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:06.500
...but it's been passed
down along with a story.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:08.730
A story?

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:16.100
One day, a bamboo
tree began to shimmer.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.530
An old man
passing by was surprised.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:22.760
He cut the bamboo open
and found a baby girl inside.

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:26.760
He brought the baby
home and named her "Kaguya".

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.960
He lovingly raised her.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:33.260
But there was one
thing unusual about her.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:39.230
Although she was able
to talk, she never tried to.

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:44.430
The rumor about her beauty spread...

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:47.360
...and many suitors
came to propose to her.

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:53.960
She refused all their
offers and just kept smiling.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:57.800
Then on her 16th birthday...

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.560
I know what happened after that.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.400
Kaguya disappeared on
the morning of her birthday,...

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.400
...leaving just this comb behind.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:14.600
People said that Kaguya had come
from the moon and returned there.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:17.860
The old couple who
raised her were devastated.

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:22.130
They prayed to the
comb for Kaguya's return.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:29.030
Then all of sudden, the field
became part of the mountain...

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:32.460
...with this bamboo fortress on top.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:34.860
I see.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:36.530
So that's it.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:43.000
I know why I had a
bad feeling, Hatsumi.

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.760
You know...

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:54.060
What?

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:57.860
How come we have to take the
long way to get to that mountain?

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.630
I am getting tired.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.830
Attention, attention.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:08.300
This is the least likely route to
draw attention from the samurai guards.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.730
I know this area.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.000
It's called the wisdom to survive.

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:16.500
You're so smart!

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:20.230
Geez, I have to find Hazuki too.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.630
So frustrated!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:28.130
Hey, you said there wouldn't
be any guards on this route!?

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:33.100
I didn't say there wouldn't be any.

00:17:33.100 --> 00:17:35.260
We have to get
through here somehow.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:37.200
Okay, I'll leave it up to you.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.060
What?

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:46.500
Come on, I bet you can take care
of those samurais in a flash, right?

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:47.930
Of course I can't.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:52.760
Hey!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:58.400
Sorry but we can't
let you go any further.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:00.300
You better take
the other road...

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.560
Those were some scary chicks!

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:29.330
Thank you for being so kind.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:31.660
Don't mention it.

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:35.400
I can't replace
your sister but...

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.130
Princess...

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:44.960
Yes?

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.630
Can I stay here a little longer?

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:54.030
Please do.

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.500
You want something?

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:08.630
Not really.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.260
The Princess...

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:17.660
...she seems to trust you.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:24.900
If our lord trusts someone,
we must trust them as well.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:32.830
If you are on our side, please
help us protect the princess.

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:34.960
I am surprised to hear that.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:38.660
You have so many
samurai guards already.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:44.200
You may be right.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.000
Still...

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.460
Good night.

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:07.560
Hey!

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:25.060
They're not so tough after all.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:30.160
That's weird, they're
usually more disciplined.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:32.400
Well, whatever.

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:41.500
Listen carefully.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.460
It's going as we
planned up to now...

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:52.330
...but the samurai in the house
are all true masters of the blade.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.860
Proceed and dispatch them quietly.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.130
Now, go!

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:53.330
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:59.760
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:02.600 --> 00:22:07.230
I will go there, praying.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:14.060
No matter the distance
between us, I will catch you.

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:21.900
That's a promise between you and I.

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:29.230
Crying, cradling my memories,...

00:22:29.230 --> 00:22:35.730
...won't help even one
of my feelings to reach you.

00:22:37.330 --> 00:22:44.760
I will offer up an eternal prayer.

00:22:44.960 --> 00:22:51.400
I will never give up on what matters.

00:22:53.360 --> 00:23:00.300
I will find the dawn
between you and I,...

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:08.730
...and meet the approaching daybreak.

00:23:09.230 --> 00:23:13.960
I will go there, praying.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:17.430
Ninjas are after the Princess!

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:18.900
So scary, scary!

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:21.360
Now, let's take a
look at the next book!

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:53.600
Next Time: Meirin
Yami, the Hat and the Book Traveler.

00:23:53.600 --> 00:23:57.000
Please enjoy the
next story as well.
